/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Given the geographic location where ENSO persists, the study aims to provide insights on how such a climate phenomenon affects the properties of tropical cyclones that formed in the Western North Pacific basin over time. Specifically, it aims to assess the feedback of TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE on each ENSO phase.)
/E (Given the geographic location where ENSO persists, the study aims to provide insights on how such a climate phenomenon affects the properties of tropical cyclones that formed in the Western North Pacific basin over time. Specifically, it aims to assess the feedback of TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE on each ENSO phase.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
