/S /H2
/T (Null: There is no significant relationship between each ENSO phase and the selected WNP TC properties \(i.e., TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE\). Alternative: There is a significant relationship between each ENSO phase and the selected WNP TC properties \(i.e., TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE\).)
/E (Null: There is no significant relationship between each ENSO phase and the selected WNP TC properties \(i.e., TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE\). Alternative: There is a significant relationship between each ENSO phase and the selected WNP TC properties \(i.e., TC frequency, TC days, TC intensity, and quarterly ACE\).)
